Cloth and ropes (src/physics/cloth.c) follow published algorithms; no code was copied:
  XPBD (Macklin, Mueller, Chentanez, MIG 2016), "Small Steps in Physics Simulation"
  (Macklin et al., SCA 2019), Long Range Attachments (Kim, Chentanez, Mueller, SCA 2012);
  the solver's structure follows Ten Minute Physics (Matthias Mueller, MIT license,
  https://github.com/matthias-research/pages) and Jolt Physics' soft bodies (Jorrit Rouwe,
  MIT license, https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics).

